# web/ — Gateway Adapters

Full guide: `docs/guidelines/web/gateways.md`. Principles: `design-principles`. Related: `services`, `jobs`.

## Role

- Wrap third-party APIs (boleto, FCM) behind small interfaces — services stay provider-agnostic.
- Inject via constructor — no `Client.new` hidden in services.

## Design

- Plain Ruby in/out; domain errors (`TransientError`) for job `retry_on`.
- Gateway does not query tenant data globally — services pass scoped records.
- `Fake` implementation for tests; WebMock/VCR only for gateway unit specs if needed.

## When to skip

- Active Storage S3 — Rails config. Email — mailer + env until second provider.
